# Who wrote this repo, canonically — for display only.
#
# Four names accumulated across 82 commits and all of them are one person and
# one collaboration: "Andy Foti" is Andre, and "Novalyst Session" was Claude
# committing under a session label. This file maps them onto two contributors
# without rewriting a single commit, which matters because specific hashes are
# recorded in the arc (Apsis, the workstream carry-forward) and a rewrite would
# invalidate every one of them.
#
# Format is: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#
# Going forward there is only one author — Andre Foti — with the model named in
# a Co-Authored-By trailer, so nothing new should ever need adding here. See
# .githooks/commit-msg.

Andre Foti <acfoti@gmail.com> Andy Foti <acfoti@gmail.com>
Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> Novalyst Session <acfoti@gmail.com>
